<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Rate My Hair Stylist</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff8fb;
      color: #2d1f28;
    }

    header {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a {
      margin-left: 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #2d1f28;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 52px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
      color: #665761;
    }

    .search-box {
      display: flex;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .search-box input {
      flex: 1;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 16px;
      outline: none;
    }

    .search-box button {
      border: none;
      background: #d95f91;
      color: white;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .features {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 25px;
      padding: 40px 8% 80px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      width: 280px;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #665761;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: white;
      color: #777;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">💇🏽‍♀️ Rate My Hair Stylist</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#">Home</a>
      <a href="#">Find a Stylist</a>
      <a href="#">Write a Review</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Find a stylist you can trust.</h1>

    <p>
      Read real reviews from real clients before you book your next appointment.
    </p>

    <div class="search-box">
      <input
        type="text"
        placeholder="Search for a stylist, service, or city..."
      >

      <button>Search</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>⭐ Read Reviews</h3>
      <p>
        See what other clients really think about their hairstylist.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>💇🏽‍♀️ Find Your Stylist</h3>
      <p>
        Search for hairstylists by name, location, or service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>💬 Share Your Experience</h3>
      <p>
        Leave a review and help someone else make their next hair decision.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Rate My Hair Stylist
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
